{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 20, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B20", "text_preview": "Announcements"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 21, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B21", "text_preview": "Release notes"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 22, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B22", "text_preview": "Ontology building"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 23, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B23", "text_preview": "The Palantir Ontology is an operational layer for the organization. The Ontology sits on top of the digital assets integrated into the Palantir platform ( datasets , virtual tables , and models ) and connects them to their real-world counte"}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 24, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B24", "text_preview": "Object and link types"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 25, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B25", "text_preview": "Defining the semantics of your organization happens by mapping existing datasources into objects, properties, and links in the Ontology. Far beyond data cataloging or schema design solutions, the Ontology allows you to define a robust found"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 26, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B26", "text_preview": "Learn about creating the semantic elements of the Ontology: object types and link types ."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 27, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B27", "text_preview": "Action types and functions"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 28, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B28", "text_preview": "The kinetics of the organization—enabling change while complying with organizational controls and governance—are defined in the Ontology using action types and functions . Action types enable you to capture data from operators in your organ"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 29, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B29", "text_preview": "Learn about creating the kinetic elements of the Ontology: action types and functions ."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 30, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B30", "text_preview": "Interfaces"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 31, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B31", "text_preview": "An interface is an Ontology type that describes the shape of an object type and its capabilities. Interfaces provide object type polymorphism, allowing for consistent modeling of and interaction with object types that share a common shape."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 32, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B32", "text_preview": "Learn more about interfaces ."}
{"kind": "heading", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 33, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B33", "text_preview": "Powering decision-making"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 34, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B34", "text_preview": "The goal of investing in the Ontology is to facilitate better decision-making in an organization at scale. To achieve this, the Ontology is deeply integrated into Palantir's user-facing analytical and operational tools: users can create reu"}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 35, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B35", "text_preview": "Learn more about how to leverage the Ontology in user-facing applications."}
{"kind": "paragraph", "local_path": "materialized_sources/corpus/industry-doc-palantir-foundry-ontology--a2f875f4/document.md", "ordinal": 36, "selector": "web://13fb2176eb2a5d27#B36", "text_preview": "Now that you know the theory, get started on building your first Ontology with our course on learn.palantir.com ↗ ."}
